acle of Kruphix her meal in Meletis and the oracle says Kruphix once spirited her away to his true temple.","participants":["diantha","kydele","kruphix","meletis"],"location":"meletis","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":198,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"When I was in danger, Kruphix spirited me away to his temple.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=When%20I%20was%20in,away%20to%20his%20temple.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=When%20I%20was%20in,away%20to%20his%20temple.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e3","summary":"Kydele feels dead inside and finds that Kruphix, who had spoken to her constantly, has fallen silent since Heliod's betrayal.","participants":["kydele","kruphix"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":198,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"But since Heliod's act of betrayal, the voice of her god had fallen silent.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e4","summary":"Kruphix speaks to Kydele, who asks whether what happened was good and why it feels wrong.","participants":["kydele","kruphix"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":198,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":48,"quote":"does it all feel so wrong?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=does%20it%20all%20feel%20so%20wrong%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=does%20it%20all%20feel%20so%20wrong%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e5","summary":"Kruphix tells Kydele that the gods are beliefs that took form in Nyx, that Heliod was not always the sun god and that gods depend on mortals believing they are unchanging.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","heliod"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":198,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"The gods are beliefs that took form within the fabric of Nyx.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=The%20gods%20are%20belief