ryone%20on%20Theros,gods%20were%20a%20lie.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e9","summary":"Kruphix reveals his fear: threats from the Eldrazi, an ancient dragon planeswalker and Phyrexia could destroy Theros while even the gods are powerless.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","kiora","ajani-goldmane","elspeth-tirel","eldrazi","phyrexia"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":198,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":125,"quote":"even the gods may be powerless to stop them.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=even%20the%20gods%20may,powerless%20to%20stop%20them.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=even%20the%20gods%20may,powerless%20to%20stop%20them.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"its-time-talk-commander-2016-edition-2016-10-26-e6","summary":"Kruphix reveals to Kydele the nature of the gods and Theros's place in the Multiverse.","participants":["kydele","kruphix","theros"],"location":"theros","importance":"major","page":"stories/its-time-talk-commander-2016-edition-2016-10-26","order":307,"story_date":"2016-10-26","storyline":"Commander (2016 Edition)","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"Kruphix himself revealed to Kydele the true nature of the gods and Theros's place in the Multiverse, a sight she can never unsee.","link":"https://magic.wizards.